{"id":"n90605-2-9","stage":2,"title":"회화 · 会话","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n90605-2-9-1","ko":"주말에는 보통 무엇을 하세요?","zh":"周末您一般都做些什么？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"주말에는","meaning":"周末","explanation":"주말：周末；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"주말","audio":"/audio/dc80d0fe247835379f4f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"19548","senseId":"1","lemma":"주말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보통","meaning":"普通，一般","explanation":"보통：普通，一般","readings":[{"term":"보통","audio":"/audio/666599febd987f532ea6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65572","senseId":"1","lemma":"보통","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"무엇을","meaning":"什么","explanation":"무엇：什么；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"무엇","audio":"/audio/c95167f3fe21887b7320.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17199","senseId":"1","lemma":"무엇","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하세요?","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"dc80d0fe24783537","term":"주말","zh":"周末","audio":"/audio/dc80d0fe247835379f4f.mp3","entryId":"19548","definition":"一周的尽头。","pronunciation":["주말"]},{"id":"666599febd987f53","term":"보통","zh":"普通，一般","audio":"/audio/666599febd987f532ea6.mp3","entryId":"65572","definition":"一般性地；或指通常。","pronunciation":["보ː통"]},{"id":"c95167f3fe21887b","term":"무엇","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/c95167f3fe21887b7320.mp3","entryId":"17199","definition":"指代不知道的事实或事物。","pronunciation":["무얻"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/7d1b1007fec756b1b028.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n90605-2-9-2","ko":"중국어 실력을 쌓으려고 학원에서 회화 수업을 들어요.","zh":"为了提升中文水平，我正在补习班上上口语课。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句